    'home.cta.headline' => 'Uhambo lwakho oluzayo luqala lapha',
    'home.cta.subtext' => 'Yeka ukukhathazeka ngokuxhumana uqale ugxile ekutheni kungani uhamba. Thola i-NaaraSim yakho ngaphambi kokuhamba — futhi ufike ulungile.',
    'home.cta.trust' => 'Ukuvula ngokushesha · Akukho zivumelwano · Amazwe angu-190+ · Ukusekela 24/7',
    'home.diagnosis.arch_eyebrow' => 'Ukwakhiwa',
    'home.diagnosis.arch_headline' => 'Wonke i-oda lidlula',
    'home.diagnosis.arch_headline_accent' => 'ezigabeni ezine.',
    'home.diagnosis.arch_intro_1' => 'Noma ngabe i-eSIM noma inombolo yocingo, i-oda lilandela indlela eyodwa: inani, indlela, ukukhokha, ukufunda. Isigaba ngasinye sinomsebenzi owodwa.',
    'home.diagnosis.arch_intro_2' => 'Yingakho amaphutha amane angenhla ahlala evaliwe. Nakhu isigaba ngasinye esikwenzayo.',
    'home.diagnosis.eyebrow' => 'Ukuxilongwa',
    'home.diagnosis.f1_label' => 'Iphutha 01',
    'home.diagnosis.f1_text' => 'I-roaming nama-SIM aseshaweni lezindiza abhiliswa ngezindlela ongakwazi ukuzibikezela. Ku-Naara uhlelo, isikhathi saso sokusebenza nenkokhelo eqondile kusesikrinini ngaphambi kokukhokha.',
    'home.diagnosis.f1_title' => 'Inani oliqonda ngemva kokukhokha',
    'home.diagnosis.f2_label' => 'Iphutha 02',
    'home.diagnosis.f2_text' => 'I-eSIM yedatha kuphela ayikwazi ukuthola ikhodi ye-SMS ebhange lakho elikuthumele nje. I-Naara ithengisa idatha nezinombolo ku-akhawunti eyodwa, esikhwameni esisodwa semali.',
    'home.diagnosis.f2_title' => 'Idatha engenayo inombolo ngemuva kwayo',
    'home.diagnosis.f3_label' => 'Iphutha 03',
    'home.diagnosis.f3_text' => 'Abahlinzeki bayehla futhi baphelelwe yisitoko. I-Naara iguqulela ngaphakathi kwendlela efanele, futhi ibuyisela isikhwama semali uma lutho olungalethwa.',
    'home.diagnosis.f3_title' => 'Uyakhokha, bese i-oda lehluleka',
    'home.diagnosis.f4_label' => 'Iphutha 04',
    'home.diagnosis.f4_text' => 'Amakhadi ahlukene, izimali nama-app. I-Naara igcina isikhwama semali esisodwa se-USD ofaka kuso imali ngokwendlela esebenza lapho ukhona.',
    'home.diagnosis.f4_title' => 'Isikhwama semali esingenakuwela umngcele',
    'home.diagnosis.headline' => 'Inkinga akusiyo isignali.',
    'home.diagnosis.headline_accent' => 'Yilokho okuhlala ngemuva kwayo.',
    'home.diagnosis.intro_1' => 'Abantu abaningi bathatha ukuhlala bexhumekile phesheya njengenkinga yokumbozwa. Ukumbozwa kuyingxenye elula. Okuphukayo yikho konke okukuzungezile: inani oliboni kuze kube ngebhili, ikhodi engafiki, i-oda elithatha imali yakho lingalethi lutho, nesikhwama semali esingakulandeli phesheya kwemingcele.',
    'home.diagnosis.intro_2' => 'I-Naara yakhelwe lawa maphutha amane. Ngezansi yilokho ngalinye elibukeka njengakho, nomsebenzi othile ovala lelo phutha.',
    'home.diagnosis.p1_label' => 'Isethembiso 01',
    'home.diagnosis.p1_sub' => 'Ngaphambi kokukhokha',
    'home.diagnosis.p1_text' => 'I-Naara ikubonisa ukuthi uthenga ini ngaphambi kokuthi uthenge: ukuthi ucingo lwakho lusekela i-eSIM, ukuthi uhlelo luhlanganisa ini, nokuthi uhambo lwakho ludinga idatha engakanani.',
    'home.diagnosis.p1_title' => 'Yazi kuqala',
    'home.diagnosis.p2_label' => 'Isethembiso 02',
    'home.diagnosis.p2_sub' => 'Bese uxhumekile',
    'home.diagnosis.p2_text' => 'Ikhodi ye-QR nekhodi yokuvula ngesandla kuvela ku-akhawunti yakho ngokushesha lapho i-oda liqinisekisiwe. Amakhodi okuqinisekisa avela ngokushesha lapho efika.',
    'home.diagnosis.p2_title' => 'Ukuskena okukodwa',
    'home.diagnosis.p3_label' => 'Isethembiso 03',
    'home.diagnosis.p3_sub' => 'Uma noma yini ihluleka',
    'home.diagnosis.p3_text' => 'Ukubuyiselwa ngokuzenzakalelayo, ikhasi lesimo eliphilayo nommeli wokusekela osebenza ku-akhawunti yakho kugcina ukwethembeka. Ama-NaaraCredits anika abantu isizathu sokubuya.',
    'home.diagnosis.p3_title' => 'Kubuyiselwe',
    'home.diagnosis.pl1_accent' => 'Yazi',
    'home.diagnosis.pl1_rest' => 'ngaphambi kokukhokha.',
    'home.diagnosis.pl2_accent' => 'Xhuma',
    'home.diagnosis.pl2_rest' => 'ngokuskena okukodwa.',
    'home.diagnosis.pl3_accent' => 'Kubuyiselwe',
    'home.diagnosis.pl3_rest' => 'uma kuhluleka.',
    'home.diagnosis.promise_eyebrow' => 'Isethembiso se-Naara',
    'home.diagnosis.promise_intro' => 'Izethembiso ezintathu, nendlela ethile ngemuva kwazo zonke. Uyazi ukuthi uthenga ini ngaphambi kokukhokha. Uxhunyiwe ngaphandle kokulinda muntu. Futhi uma okuthile kuhluleka, imali yakho ibuyela ngaphandle kwethikithi.',
    'home.diagnosis.s1_label' => 'Isigaba 01',
    'home.diagnosis.s1_text' => 'Uhlelo ngalunye nenombolo ngayinye kunikezwa inani endaweni eyodwa. Inani elibaliwe ekukhokheni yilona elikhokhiswayo, nelinani erisidini lakho.',
    'home.diagnosis.s1_title' => 'Inani → Umthombo owodwa',
    'home.diagnosis.s2_label' => 'Isigaba 02',
    'home.diagnosis.s2_text' => 'Ama-eSIM aguqulelana ngaphakathi kwendlela yawo. Izinombolo zihamba kumhlinzeki ongumnikazi wezwe nohlobo. Izindlela azitholelani.',
    'home.diagnosis.s2_title' => 'Indlela → Umhlinzeki ofanele, indlela efanele',
    'home.diagnosis.s3_label' => 'Isigaba 03',
    'home.diagnosis.s3_text' => 'Konke ukukhishwa kuyi-athomu, kuvaliwe futhi akuphindwa, futhi kushiya umugqa wencwadi yokulondoloza nesikhwama semali ngaphambi nangemva.',
    'home.diagnosis.s3_title' => 'Ukukhokha → Imali ihamba kanye',
    'home.diagnosis.s4_label' => 'Isigaba 04',
    'home.diagnosis.s4_text' => 'Isibali sangemuva sinikeza izinga kumiphumela ye-oda ngalinye eliqediwe. Alihlali ngaphakathi kokuthengwa bukhoma, ngakho ukufunda akunakulibambezela.',
    'home.diagnosis.s4_title' => 'Ukufunda → Ukwethembeka okukhulayo',
    'home.faq.cta' => 'Usanemibuzo? Ithimba lethu lokusekela liphendula ngemizuzu — hhayi ngamahora.',
    'home.faq.cta_all' => 'Bona yonke imibuzo',
    'home.faq.cta_contact' => 'Xhumana nathi',
    'home.faq.g1_a1' => 'I-Naara iyinkundla yokuxhumana yase-Pan-African. Ku-app eyodwa nasesikhwameni esisodwa semali ungathenga izinhlelo zedatha ye-eSIM zamazwe angu-190+ nezinombolo zocingo (izinombolo zokuqinisekisa nomugqa ohlala njalo). Isethembiso sethu: Hlala Uxhumekile. Akukho Mingcele. Akukho Ukushintsha.',
    'home.faq.g1_a2' => 'Kusukela ekuthengeni kuya ekuxhumekeni ngokuvamile kuthatha ngaphansi kwemizuzu emithathu: thenga uhlelo, skena ikhodi ye-QR, futhi idatha yakho iqala lapho uxhumeka okokuqala lapho uya khona.',
    'home.faq.g1_label' => 'Ukuqala',
    'home.faq.g1_q1' => 'Iyini i-Naara?',
    'home.faq.g1_q2' => 'Ngingaxhumeka ngokushesha kangakanani?',
    'home.faq.g2_a1' => 'Iningi lamafoni akhishwe kusukela cishe ngo-2018 ayasebenza, kodwa kufanele futhi avulwe enkampanini yamakholi. Kumafoni amaningi, ukushayela *#06# kubonisa inombolo ye-EID lapho i-eSIM isekelwa — noma sebenzisa isihloli sethu sokuhambisana.',
    'home.faq.g2_a2' => 'Izinhlelo ezingenamkhawulo zingaphansi kwenqubomgomo yokusetshenziswa okufanele: ngemva kwesabelo sansuku zonke noma esiphelele sesivinini esiphezulu, izivinini zingehliswa. Isabelo esiqondile sibonisiwe kuhlelo ngalunye ngaphambi kokuthi uthenge.',
    'home.faq.g2_label' => 'Idatha ye-eSIM',
    'home.faq.g2_q1' => 'Ucingo lwami luzosebenza nge-eSIM?',
    'home.faq.g2_q2' => 'Kusho ini "okungenamkhawulo" ezinhlelweni ezingenamkhawulo?',
    'home.faq.g3_a1' => 'Uma kungafiki ikhodi ngaphakathi kwemizuzu engu-15 yokuoda, isikhwama sakho semali sibuyiselwa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Akukho thikithi futhi akukho ukulinda imvume.',
    'home.faq.g3_a2' => 'Izinombolo zokuqinisekisa zenzelwe amakhodi e-SMS. Ngamakholi, sebenzisa i-Naara Line — inombolo ehlala njalo enokushaya.',
    'home.faq.g3_label' => 'Izinombolo zokuqinisekisa',
    'home.faq.g3_q1' => 'Kuthiwani uma ikhodi yami ingafiki?',
    'home.faq.g3_q2' => 'Ingabe inombolo ingathola amakholi ezwi?',
    'home.faq.g4_a1' => 'Cha. Inani oliqinisekisayo yilona elikhokhayo, futhi ukukhokha kubonisa intela nezimali njengo-$0.00.',
    'home.faq.g4_a2' => 'Amakhadi nokudluliselwa kwasebhange kuyatholakala. Kwamanye amazwe, njengeGhana neKenya, imali yeselula iyatholakala nayo. Izinketho ekukhokheni zincike ekutheni ukuphi.',
    'home.faq.g4_label' => 'Isikhwama semali namanani',
    'home.faq.g4_q1' => 'Ingabe kukhona izimali ezifihliwe?',
    'home.faq.g4_q2' => 'Ngingafaka kanjani imali?',
    'home.faq.g5_a1' => 'Sihlose ukuba nobulungisa nokwethembeka. Ama-eSIM angaqalwanga ayabuyiselwa, izinombolo ezingatholi ikhodi ziyabuyiselwa ngokuzenzakalelayo, futhi ukubuyiselwa okuvunyiwe kubuyela esikhwameni sakho semali.',
    'home.faq.g5_a2' => 'Isikhwama sakho semali sirekhodwe njengencwadi yokulondoloza, futhi izinguquko zebhalansi ziyi-athomu, ngakho isinyathelo esehlulekile asikushiyi ukhokhile ngaphandle kwe-oda noma ukubuyiselwa.',
    'home.faq.g5_label' => 'Ukubuyisela nokwethembeka',
    'home.faq.g5_q1' => 'Iyiphi inqubomgomo yakho yokubuyisela ngamafuphi?',
    'home.faq.g5_q2' => 'Ingabe imali yami iphephile uma isistimu iwa?',
    'home.faq.headline' => 'Imibuzo esiyizwa kaningi',
    'home.features.eyebrow' => 'Yakhelwe ngokuhlukile',
    'home.features.f1_text' => 'Akukho ukulinda ukuthunyelwa. I-eSIM yakho ifika ku-imeyili yakho ngokushesha lapho ukhokha. Yivule noma kuphi emhlabeni.',
    'home.features.f1_title' => 'Ukulethwa kwedijithali ngokushesha',
    'home.features.f2_text' => 'I-NaaraSim yakho isebenza eduze kwe-SIM yakho evamile. Amakholi nemibhalo isafika enombolweni yakho yasekhaya. I-NaaraSim iphatha idatha yakho.',
    'home.features.f2_title' => 'Gcina inombolo yakho',
    'home.features.f3_text' => 'Izinhlelo zasekhaya, zesifunda nezomhlaba ziyatholakala. Noma ngabe uwela umngcele owodwa noma eyishumi, kunohlelo lwe-NaaraSim lwendlela yakho.',
    'home.features.f3_title' => 'Amazwe angu-190+, inkundla eyodwa',
    'home.features.f4_text' => 'Uyazi ngqo ukuthi ukhokha ini ngaphambi kokuhamba. Uhlelo olusetshiwe. Akukho ukumangala. Inethiwekhi yakho yasekhaya ihlala ivaliwe edatheni phesheya.',
    'home.features.f4_title' => 'Awekho amabhili e-roaming',
    'home.features.f5_text' => 'Uphelelwa idatha phakathi kohambo? Engeza idatha eyengeziwe ku-app ngaphandle kokuthenga uhlelo olusha. I-eSIM yakho ihlala isebenza, ukuxhumana kwakho kuhlala kuqinile.',
    'home.features.f5_title' => 'Faka imali noma nini',
    'home.features.f6_text' => 'I-NaaraSim yakhelwe ngokucabanga ngomhambi wase-Afrika. Ukusekela okuqonda uhambo lwakho. Amanani ahlonipha iqiniso lakho.',
    'home.features.f6_title' => 'Yakhelwe abahambi base-Afrika',
    'home.features.headline' => 'Ukuthi kungani abahambi bekhetha i-NaaraSim',
    'home.hero.cta_primary' => 'Thola i-eSIM yakho manje',
    'home.hero.cta_secondary' => 'Bona ukuthi isebenza kanjani',
    'home.hero.eyebrow' => 'I-eSIM yama-Afrika omhlaba wonke',
    'home.hero.flags_label' => 'Amazwe angu-190+ · i-eSIM eyodwa · akukho mingcele',
    'home.hero.headline' => 'Finyelela noma kuphi. Xhuma ngokushesha.',
    'home.hero.social_proof' => 'Ethenjwa abahambi abasuka eLagos, e-Accra, eNairobi nakwezinye · Amazwe angu-190+ · Isebenza ngaphansi kwemizuzu emi-3',
    'home.hero.spot_link_label' => 'Hlola i-NaaraSim',
    'home.hero.spot_status' => 'Kuxhumekile',
    'home.hero.spot_title_1' => 'I-app eyodwa.',
    'home.hero.spot_title_2' => 'Konke ukuxhumana.',
    'home.hero.stat_1' => 'Amazwe angu-190+',
    'home.hero.stat_2' => 'Imizuzu emi-3 yokusetha',
    'home.hero.stat_3' => 'I-SIM ephathekayo engu-0',
    'home.hero.stat_4' => 'Ukusekela 24/7',
    'home.hero.subheadline' => 'I-NaaraSim ikunika uhlelo lwedatha lasekhaya emazweni angaphezu kuka-190 — olusebenza kucingo lwakho ngaphambi kokuthi uhambe ekhaya. Awekho amakhadi e-SIM. Awekho amakhawunta aseshaweni lezindiza. Awekho amashokhi e-roaming.',
    'home.hero.who_1_desc' => 'Ikhaya lapho kukhona abantu bakho. Gcina inombolo eyodwa ifinyeleleka kuzo zonke izinkambo ezibuyela ekhaya, futhi ufike nedatha esivele isebenza — akukho SIM entsha, akukho shokhi ye-roaming, akukho ukuchaza enkantolo yezintela.',
    'home.hero.who_1_title' => 'Abaphesheya nabahamba kaningi',
    'home.hero.who_2_desc' => 'Umhlangano wakho awunandaba ukuthi uvuke kuliphi izwe. Thola idatha engethemba emazweni angu-190+ ukuze ukuthunyelwa, ikholi noma isikhathi sokugcina singalindi ukuthola isitolo se-SIM.',
    'home.hero.who_2_title' => 'Abahamba ngokuzimela nabasebenza ngokukude',
    'home.hero.who_3_desc' => 'Ikhampasi entsha, inombolo efanayo. Hlala ufinyeleleka emndenini, ama-OTP asebhange namakholi evisa ekhaya, kuyilapho uhlelo lwakho lwedatha lwe-Naara lukumboza kusukela ngesikhathi ufika.',
    'home.hero.who_3_title' => 'Abafundi abafunda phesheya',
    'home.hero.who_4_desc' => 'Vala isivumelwano eLagos, landelela e-Accra, thumela eNairobi — esontweni elilodwa. Inombolo yasekhaya yakha ukwethembana emhlabathini; uhlelo lwedatha lwe-Naara lukugcina usakwi-inthanethi phakathi kokumisa ngakunye.',
    'home.hero.who_4_title' => 'Abahwebi nosomabhizinisi abawela imingcele',
    'home.hero.who_5_desc' => 'Awekho amakhawunta e-SIM aseshaweni lezindiza. Alukho ukuvinjelwa kolimi esitolo. Vula i-eSIM yakho ngaphambi kokuthi ugibele, ukuze into yokuqala oyenzayo uma ufika ibe yilokho okuzele ukukwenza.',
    'home.hero.who_5_title' => 'Abahamba okokuqala nabathwala izikhwama zomhlane',
    'home.hero.who_6_desc' => 'Hlomisa iqembu lonke ngezinombolo nedatha kudeshibhodi eyodwa. Lungiselela, qaphela futhi ufake imali ekuxhumeni kwelungu ngalinye ngaphandle kokuphatha ama-akhawunti ezinkampani zamakholi amahlanu.',
    'home.hero.who_6_title' => 'Amaqembu namabhizinisi asekude',
    'home.hero.who_eyebrow' => 'Ukuthi i-Naara ingeyabani',
    'home.hero.who_heading' => 'Yenzelwe indlela ohamba ngayo.',
    'home.hero.who_subtext' => 'Umndeni owodwa wokuxhumana, owakhelwe uhlobo ngalunye lomuntu owela imingcele. Zitholele ngezansi.',
    'home.hero.world_body' => 'Hlala uxhumekile noma ngabe impilo ikuyisa kuphi. Thola ama-eSIM, izinombolo zasekhaya nesikhwama semali esihlakaniphile seselula — konke kunkundla eyodwa elula eyakhelwe ama-Afrika omhlaba wonke.',
    'home.hero.world_title_1' => 'Umhlaba wakho.',
    'home.hero.world_title_2' => 'Ukuxhumana okukodwa.',
    'home.how.cta' => 'Qala manje — kusheshe',
    'home.how.eyebrow' => 'Kulula ngokuklanywa',
    'home.how.headline' => 'Xhuma ngezinyathelo ezintathu',
    'home.how.step_1_text' => 'Khetha izwe noma isifunda oya kuso bese ukhetha uhlelo lwedatha olufanele uhambo lwakho — kusukela esikhashini sempelasonto kuya ohlelweni lwezinsuku ezingu-30.',
    'home.how.step_1_title' => 'Khetha lapho uya khona',
    'home.how.step_2_text' => 'Qhathanisa izinhlelo zasekhaya, zesifunda nezomhlaba ngosayizi nobude, bese ukhokha ngokuphepha. Ikhodi ye-QR ye-eSIM yakho ifika ebhokisini lakho lemeyili ngokushesha lapho uphothula ukukhokha.',
    'home.how.step_2_title' => 'Khetha uhlelo lwakho lwedatha',
    'home.how.step_3_text' => 'Skena ikhodi ye-QR noma ulandele ukusetha okuqondisiwe — i-eSIM ifakwa cishe ngemizuzu emibili. Uma nje ufika, i-NaaraSim ixhuma kumanethiwekhi asekhaya ngokuzenzakalelayo.',
    'home.how.step_3_title' => 'Vula kucingo lwakho',
    'home.how.subtext' => 'Akukho ukuvakashela izitolo. Akukho amaphepha. Akukho ukulinda. Ucingo nje nemizuzu emibili.',
    'home.manifesto.body' => 'I-Naara ikhona ngoba ukuhlala uxhumekile akufanele kuncike emngceleni, olayini noma ebhilini elimangazayo. Sakhe isikhwama semali esisodwa sedatha, izinombolo nezipho, esibiweyo ngokweqiniso, esilethwa ngemizuzu, futhi esibuyiselwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma sihluleka. Akukho ukushintsha ama-SIM. Akukho izimali ezifihliwe. Akukho amaphutha. Ukuxhumana kuphela okusebenza ngendlela ebusuku ubulindele ngayo.',
    'home.manifesto.tag' => 'Isimemezelo sethu',
    'home.manifesto.title' => 'Esimelele',
    'home.manifesto.title_accent' => 'kuko.',
    'home.pricing.callout' => 'Izinhlelo ziqala ku-$5 · Akukho izimali ezifihliwe · Khansela noma nini',
    'home.pricing.cta' => 'Bona zonke izinhlelo',
    'home.pricing.eyebrow' => 'Amanani acacile',
    'home.pricing.headline' => 'Izinhlelo ezinengqondo',
    'home.pricing.text' => 'Awekho amafi eyinyanga. Awekho amanani eziqinisekisiwe. Khokha kuphela okudingayo — kungaba yikhadi lezinsuku ezi-3 noma uhlelo lomhlaba lwezinsuku ezingu-30. Uhlelo ngalunye lufaka ukuvula ngokushesha nokusekela 24/7.',
    'home.pricing.trust' => 'Ukhokha kuphela uma uhamba. Akukho ukubhalisa okudingekayo.',
    'home.products.eyebrow' => 'Umndeni owodwa, konke kuxhumene',
    'home.products.headline' => 'Okunikwa yi-Naara',
    'home.products.subtext' => 'I-Naara ngumndeni. I-NaaraSim ikugcina uxhumekile — idatha nezinombolo emazweni angu-190+. I-Naara Gift ikuvumela ukuthi uthumele amabhrendi abantu abawathandayo. I-akhawunti eyodwa, isikhwama semali esisodwa, i-Naara eyodwa.',
    'home.testimonials.eyebrow' => 'Abahambi bangempela, ukuxhumana kwangempela',
    'home.testimonials.headline' => 'Okushiwo ngamakhasimende ethu',
    'home.testimonials.t1_quote' => 'Ngisethe i-NaaraSim yami ebusuku ngaphambi kwendiza yami, futhi ngesikhathi ngifika eHeathrow, ucingo lwami lwase lubonisa imigoqo egcwele. Angizange ngibone nomzuzu oxhumeke ngawo. Yilokho kanye okufanele kusebenze ngakho.',
    'home.testimonials.t2_quote' => 'Ngike ngasebenzisa ama-app e-eSIM amathathu ahlukene ngaphambi kwe-NaaraSim. Alikho kuwo elalizwakala lenzelwe mina. Le isebenza ngempela emazweni engihamba kuwo, futhi inqubo yokufaka imali ilula kangangokuthi ngiyenze ngisemotweni yetekisi.',
    'home.testimonials.t3_quote' => 'Ukusetha kwathatha ngempela imizuzu emibili. Okuhlangenwe nakho kwami kwangaphambili nge-roaming kwakubuhlungu — amabhili ayamangalisa, izindawo ezingenasignali, amahora ocingweni nesevisi yamakhasimende. I-NaaraSim yakusombulula konke lokho ekuthengeni okukodwa.',
    'home.wizard.body' => 'Akusekho ukuzingela inombolo efanele noma uhlelo oluhle kakhulu. Tshela i-NaaraSim Intelligent Wizard ukuthi udingani — izwe, insizakalo, isabelomali — futhi iyaqhuba usesho ngawe, ifanise ukunambitheka kwakho nenombolo noma i-eSIM ephelele kunoma yisiphi isizathu esithembekile, ngemizuzwana.',
    'home.wizard.bullet_1' => 'Yitshele okuthandayo — iyakufanisa',
    'home.wizard.bullet_2' => 'Izinombolo ze-OTP ne-SMS zanoma yikuphi ukuqinisekisa',
    'home.wizard.bullet_3' => 'Imigqa elungele izwi, uma kudingeka',
