    'how-it-works.compatibility.cta' => 'Hlola Idivayisi Yami',
    'how-it-works.compatibility.headline' => 'Ucingo Lwakho Lusekela I-NaaraSim?',
    'how-it-works.compatibility.intro' => 'I-NaaraSim isebenza kunoma iyiphi idivayisi ehambisana ne-eSIM engakhiyiwe enkampanini yamakholi. Sesha isihloli esiphilayo ngezansi, noma ubuze ukusekela kwethu — sizoqinisekisa ngemizuzu.',
    'how-it-works.compatibility.note' => 'Idivayisi yakho akufanele ikhiywe enkampanini yamakholi, futhi amanye amafoni ezifunda awanazo izingxenye ze-eSIM.',
    'how-it-works.hero.headline' => 'Kusukela Ekuthengeni Kuya Ekuxhumekeni Ngaphansi Kwemizuzu Emi-3',
    'how-it-works.hero.proof' => 'Akukho ukuvakashela izitolo · Akukho SIM ephathekayo · Akukho ukusetha i-roaming · Isebenza kumafoni amaningi anamuhla',
    'how-it-works.hero.subtext' => 'I-NaaraSim yakhelwe ukuba lula. Nansi indlela esebenza ngayo ngqo — akukho ulwazi lwezobuchwepheshe oludingekayo.',
    'how-it-works.steps.headline' => 'Izinyathelo Ezigcwele',
    'how-it-works.steps.s1_text' => 'Ngaphambi kokuthenga, qinisekisa ukuthi ucingo lwakho lusekela i-eSIM futhi alukhiyiwe enkampanini yamakholi. Amafoni amaningi enziwe ngemva kuka-2019 alungele i-eSIM. Sebenzisa isihloli sethu sokuhambisana noma ubheke "eSIM" ezilungiselelweni zakho zocingo ngaphansi kwe-Mobile Data.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s1_title' => 'Hlola Idivayisi Yakho',
    'how-it-works.steps.s2_text' => 'Phequlula izinhlelo ngendawo oya kuyo — zasekhaya (izwe elilodwa), zesifunda (iqembu lamazwe), noma zomhlaba. Khetha usayizi wedatha nobude obufana nohambo lwakho. Izinhlelo ziqala ku-1GB.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s2_title' => 'Khetha Uhlelo Lwakho',
    'how-it-works.steps.s3_text' => 'Khokha ngokuphepha usebenzisa ikhadi lakho noma indlela yokukhokha yeselula. Ikhodi ye-QR ye-eSIM yakho nemiyalo yokuvula kuthunyelwa ku-imeyili yakho ngokushesha ngemva kokukhokha. Akukho ukulinda.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s3_title' => 'Qedela Ukuthenga Kwakho',
    'how-it-works.steps.s4_text' => 'Skena ikhodi ye-QR evela ku-imeyili yakho noma uye ku-Settings → Mobile Data → Add eSIM. Ukufaka kuthatha cishe imizuzwana engu-90. Yenza lokhu ngenkathi usenayo i-Wi-Fi noma ukufinyelela kunethiwekhi yasekhaya.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s4_title' => 'Faka Ngaphambi Kokuhamba',
    'how-it-works.steps.s5_text' => 'Ngemva kokufaka, setha i-NaaraSim njenge-SIM oyikhethile yedatha. Gcina i-SIM yakho yasekhaya isebenza kumakholi nemibhalo.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s5_title' => 'Setha i-NaaraSim Njenge-SIM Yakho Yedatha',
    'how-it-works.steps.s6_text' => 'Uma ufika, ucingo lwakho lukhula luxhume enethiwekhi yasekhaya ngokuzenzakalelayo. Vala i-roaming yedatha ku-SIM yakho yasekhaya ukuze uugweme izimali zenkampani yamakholi. I-NaaraSim iphatha konke okunye.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s6_title' => 'Fika Futhi Uxhume',
    'how-it-works.steps.s7_text' => 'Uphelelwa idatha? Ngena ku-akhawunti yakho ye-NaaraSim bese wengeza idatha eyengeziwe kuhlelo lwakho olukhona ngaphandle kokufaka kabusha noma ukuskena kabusha lutho.',
    'how-it-works.steps.s7_title' => 'Faka Imali Uma Kudingeka',
    'how-it-works.support.cta' => 'Xhumana Nokusekela',
    'how-it-works.support.headline' => 'Silapha Uma Usidinga',
    'how-it-works.support.promise' => 'Asivali amathikithi okusekela kuze kuxazululwe inkinga yakho ngempela. Hhayi nje "kwaphendulwa." Kuxazululwe.',
    'how-it-works.support.text' => 'Ukusetha okuningi kwe-NaaraSim kuhamba kahle ngaphandle kosizo. Kodwa uhambo alubikezeleki, futhi siyakwazi lokho. Uma okuthile kungasebenzi — inkinga yedivayisi, inkinga yenethiwekhi, noma umbuzo olula — ithimba lethu lokusekela liphendula ngemizuzu, hhayi ngamahora.',
